              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "l'association — \"the association, the club, the charity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Je travaille dans une association qui aide les personnes âgées. I work for an association that helps elderly people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In France, une association is a non-profit group of any kind. Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
